  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n371 + 372 + 373 + 374 + 375 \n\n**Formula used:**\n\naⁿ + aⁿ ⁺ ¹ = aⁿ(1 + a) \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n371 + 372 + 373 + 374 + 375 \n\n⇒ 371(1 + 3 + 3² + 3³ + 3⁴)\n\n⇒ 371(1 + 3 + 9 + 27 + 81)\n\n⇒ 371(1 + 3 + 9 + 27 + 81)\n\n⇒371×121 \n\n⇒371×11×11\n\n∴ The expression 371×11×11 has 11 as its factor.\n\n**∴ It is divisible by 11. **",
